\newlabel{fig:q7-expectations}{{4}{5}{The resulting expectation values of the different columns after a $pi/2$ pulse. Notice that, as before, the effect of the magnetic field is strongest where it is close to resonance, i.e. the centre column}{figure.caption.4}{}}
